        "name": "Void Shift",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "When he hasn't recently taken damage or been crowd controlled, Malzahar gains massive damage reduction and crowd control immunity, lingering for a short period after taking damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "Malzahar gains 90% damage reduction and immunity from <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Disabling</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Immobilizing</span> effects, lingering for 0.25 seconds after taking damage or blocking one of those effects. This effect has a 12 second Cooldown.",
