        "bodyHtml": "Malzahar <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Suppresses</span> an enemy champion and deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(125/200/275 + ([[si:scaleap]]80% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> over 2.5 seconds. A zone of negative energy is created around his target dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(10/15/20% + ([[si:scaleap]]2.5% per 100 Ability Power)) max Health magic damage</span> over 5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocks Down</span> enemies.</span>",
